e candidate, private codec fork, Module 04 work, upstream publication or production activation is included. Actual human architecture/security owners and approval references remain PENDING.\n\nIndependent component reviews accept the scoped documentation, upstream proof, observer diagnostics and corrected regression evidence. Failed collector/scanner/cleanup-review attempts remain explicitly ineligible with safe provenance; flagged telemetry content is excluded from publishable ancestry without scanner suppression. Final integration review and exact local/hosted receipts are linked in `docs/reports/sprint04c-completion.md` and subsequent closeout evidence.\n\nValidation: full fixture-locked `make check`, `make security-scan`, resource/private-fixture cleanup, immutable-source and manifest verification, independent security review, and exact-head hosted `foundation-quality` / `supply-chain-security` are required before merge. Module 04-12 stay LOCKED and production stays BLOCKED.\n","created_at":"2026-11-14T09:52:26Z","updated_at":"2026-11-14T09:55:32Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tiecont/aegis-gate/pulls/15/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tiecont/aegis-gate/pulls/15/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tiecont/aegis-gate/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tiecont/aegis-gate/issues/15/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tiecont/aegis-gate/statuses/4855552ffb7e46b48aac9d668ff459cbfc270ed5","head":{"label":"tiecont:sprint/04c-integration","ref":"sprint/04c-integration","sha":"4855552ffb7e46b48aac9d668ff459cbfc270ed5","user":{"login":"tiecont","id":119944305,"node_id":"U_kgDOByY0cQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119944305?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.gith